Modifications made by Arush Sharma, 2026-10-29
----------------------------------------------
- Fully offline build: a Content Security Policy (connect-src 'self') blocks
  all outbound network connections from the extension.
- Removed the daily update check, telemetry, A/B test sign-up, filter hit
  statistics, Safe Browsing lookups and remote metadata/filter downloads.
- The first-run page and uninstall page no longer open any website.
- Removed content scripts that let a website change extension settings.
- Hidden UI for disabled online services, product promotions, ratings,
  issue reporting to the upstream website and settings sharing.
- New name, icons, logo and UI text (AdZap Offline). A post-build step
  (tools/adzap/postbuild.mjs) rebrands text that comes from bundled packages.

Files that were changed carry a "Modified ... for AdZap Offline" line in their
license header. The full history of changes is in this repository's git log;
the first commit is the unmodified upstream source.

